   "spoken": "White offers the Smith-Morra Gambit with the pawn to c3, hoping Black grabs the pawn and lets him develop with a lead. Against it there's a practical, rarely-seen answer coming — one good enough to win a strong Titled Tuesday game.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "The Smith-Morra trades a pawn for development; a rare declining line can sidestep all White's prep.",
   "plans": "Decline the gambit, keep it solid."
