   "spoken": "And now the tactical eye earns its keep. The pawn on c3 is the standing target, but there's a sharper idea: whenever White has pushed the f-pawn with the king on g1, tactics along the a7-g1 diagonal are in the air. The knight to g4 is the shot that cashes in.",
